{
  "description": "Learner-facing catalogue category for each Core/Reference sign: where a learner should look to find it. This is navigation only and is deliberately separate from the official Schedule family, which stays in sign-meta.json and learner-scope.json. A sign may be legally Regulatory while its learner category is Lane Use & Turns. Maps App ID to category and nothing else — names, artwork and designations stay canonical where they already live.",
